{
  "source": "course-assets/curious-and-flexible/curious-and-flexible.mp4",
  "duration": 212.544,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.1,
      "text": "Imagine you are the captain of your school's basketball team."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.74,
      "end": 6.96,
      "text": "You have a reliable play that has worked perfectly all season long,"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.68,
      "end": 9.6,
      "text": "scoring points every single time you run it."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.18,
      "end": 13.64,
      "text": "Then during a crucial game, another team figures out how to block it."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.2,
      "end": 16.0,
      "text": "Suddenly, your go-to strategy fails."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.84,
      "end": 18.84,
      "text": "Your next move requires a specific mindset."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.76,
      "end": 23.24,
      "text": "First, you have to be curious enough to actively look for a better play."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.96,
      "end": 27.2,
      "text": "Second, you must be flexible enough to stop relying on the old one,"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.54,
      "end": 28.72,
      "text": "even if you know it by heart."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.08,
      "end": 32.96,
      "text": "Artificial intelligence demands this exact approach."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.7,
      "end": 36.2,
      "text": "The tools and models available today update rapidly."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.98,
      "end": 39.6,
      "text": "The specific prompt or workflow you relied on last month"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.6,
      "end": 42.16,
      "text": "can easily break or become obsolete tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.96,
      "end": 45.26,
      "text": "The sheer volume of these updates can feel overwhelming,"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.96,
      "end": 48.58,
      "text": "but survival does not require chasing every new feature."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.04,
      "end": 52.02,
      "text": "You simply need to balance the curiosity to explore changes"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.02,
      "end": 55.34,
      "text": "with the flexibility to adjust when a better path opens up."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.4,
      "end": 59.56,
      "text": "This board outlines four simple habits for staying curious."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.28,
      "end": 62.98,
      "text": "It shows how you can manage the discovery process deliberately"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.54,
      "end": 66.06,
      "text": "without needing to track every single tech announcement."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.02,
      "end": 69.34,
      "text": "The first habit is to use AI regularly,"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.88,
      "end": 72.12,
      "text": "especially outside of your required schoolwork."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.82,
      "end": 75.38,
      "text": "This baseline familiarity makes it much easier"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.38,
      "end": 78.02,
      "text": "to notice when an interface suddenly gains new abilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.08,
      "end": 80.42,
      "text": "Next, you should check what changed."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.28,
      "end": 84.26,
      "text": "Look out for update notices, new buttons, or model names."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.86,
      "end": 86.66,
      "text": "Constant monitoring isn't necessary."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.44,
      "end": 89.38,
      "text": "Checking occasionally gives you the information you need."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.08,
      "end": 93.38,
      "text": "To avoid feeling overwhelmed, follow one reliable source."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.06,
      "end": 96.3,
      "text": "Pick a single trustworthy newsletter, educator,"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.86,
      "end": 98.02,
      "text": "or official product page."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.74,
      "end": 101.12,
      "text": "Calling your inputs down to one curated feed"
    },
    {
      "start": 101.12,
      "end": 103.46,
      "text": "provides enough information to stay informed."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.46,
      "end": 105.9,
      "text": "Finally, compare with others."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.58,
      "end": 108.72,
      "text": "Ask your friends, teachers, or club members"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.72,
      "end": 109.86,
      "text": "what they have tried recently."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.64,
      "end": 113.6,
      "text": "Different people naturally stumble upon different tools and features."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.23,
      "end": 117.76,
      "text": "By building these habits, you let the most useful changes"
    },
    {
      "start": 117.76,
      "end": 121.16,
      "text": "surface naturally, instead of constantly hunting for them."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.8,
      "end": 125.34,
      "text": "Finding a new tool is only the first step."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.02,
      "end": 128.38,
      "text": "This second board shows the evaluation phase."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.22,
      "end": 132.18,
      "text": "Flexibility means resisting the urge to discard"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.18,
      "end": 134.84,
      "text": "your current workflow the moment an update arrives."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.74,
      "end": 137.26,
      "text": "You must start with a real need."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.82,
      "end": 141.4,
      "text": "Consider whether the new feature maps to a task you actually perform."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.4,
      "end": 146.04,
      "text": "If it doesn't, you are creating a solution for a problem that does not exist."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.04,
      "end": 150.6,
      "text": "When you do find a potential match, test it on familiar work."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.14,
      "end": 154.22,
      "text": "Try applying the new tool to an assignment you have already completed."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.02,
      "end": 159.24,
      "text": "Because you know the material, you can accurately judge the actual difference in performance."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.36,
      "end": 162.2,
      "text": "Then, explicitly compare the results."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.08,
      "end": 167.14,
      "text": "Evaluate the quality, time, effort, and reliability of the output."
    },
    {
      "start": 167.7,
      "end": 171.98,
      "text": "Newer technology does not automatically guarantee better quality or less effort."
    },
    {
      "start": 172.72,
      "end": 174.7,
      "text": "This leads to the ultimate rule of flexibility."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.62,
      "end": 176.72,
      "text": "Keep what works best."
    },
    {
      "start": 177.26,
      "end": 180.96,
      "text": "Adopt the new approach only when it yields a measurable improvement"
    },
    {
      "start": 180.96,
      "end": 184.06,
      "text": "and ruthlessly keep your old method if it does not."
    },
    {
      "start": 185.46,
      "end": 187.32,
      "text": "Look at how these elements combine."
    },
    {
      "start": 188.38,
      "end": 189.72,
      "text": "Curiosity finds the new possibility,"
    },
    {
      "start": 190.28,
      "end": 194.82,
      "text": "but flexibility makes the final decision on whether it actually belongs in your workflow."
    },
    {
      "start": 195.53,
      "end": 198.58,
      "text": "These two skills must operate continuously in tandem"
    },
    {
      "start": 198.58,
      "end": 200.64,
      "text": "as you navigate shifting technologies."
    },
    {
      "start": 202.38,
      "end": 202.9,
      "text": "Be curious."
    },
    {
      "start": 203.62,
      "end": 203.98,
      "text": "Be flexible."
    },
    {
      "start": 204.96,
      "end": 207.6,
      "text": "That is how you keep up when the technology keeps changing."
    }
  ],
